# The public URL this game is served from.
#
# Used only for metadata: it turns the tab icon and the link-preview card into
# the absolute URLs that Open Graph and Twitter require. Nothing secret goes in
# this file, and nothing here changes gameplay.
#
# Leave it unset for local development — the app falls back to
# http://localhost:3500, the port `npm run dev` uses.
#
# On Vercel you can also leave it unset: VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL and
# VERCEL_URL are supplied automatically and are picked up in that order.
#
# Set it explicitly when deploying anywhere else, or to pin a custom domain:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://earnyourskyline.example
